list.item:
Sisco met with Rabin late afternoon Sept 21. Read him King’s answer to
                       Allon (Amman 5023) and Rifai comments (Sisco cautioned Rabin re Rifai fluctuations
                       from euphoria to depression and back.)

note.p:
Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, POL 27 ARAB–ISR. Secret;
                    Immediate; Nodis. Drafted on September 21 by Stackhouse; cleared by Atherton;
                    and approved by Sisco. It was repeated to Amman. Passed to the White House.
